id=nemu_boot_autostart
name=Nemu Boot Guard
version=1.13
versionCode=14
author=Nemu
description=Auto-unbrick guard (3 failed boots): verified clean shutdowns reset the counter; bounded recovery with verification; only Nemu-owned suspend/disable-user/components/hidden/AppOps/standby states are restored. v1.13 replays Nemu's ownership restore script once after boot_completed (before the app trigger), covering unclean adb reboot/power loss; it then sends the post-boot trigger to the app. On a normal boot it restores only packages carrying Nemu's suspended_by_nemu marker, and clears a marker only after a positive suspended=false readback.
